{"id":"000VSA","title":"Eighteen Truth Tellers Walk into a Bar...","author":"sisaloofafump","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-31T02:28:04+00:00","posted":"Heute, 02:56 Uhr","rules":"A little mystery puzzle for halloween!\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\nRed herrings: Each of the following clue types appear in the grid 4 times. However, only 3 of each type's appearances are correct. It is up to the solver to figure out which clues are truths and which are lies.\n\nArrows: Digits along an arrow must sum to the number in the attached circle.\n\nKropki dots: Digits separated by a black dot are in a 1:2 ratio.\n\nLittle killers: Digits outside the grid are the sum of all the cells along the diagonal that the arrow points to.\n\nQuadruples: Digits in the white circles must be found in the immediately surrounding cells.\n\nCages: Digits in a cage must be equal to the number in the cage's top corner.\n\nXs: Digits separated by an X sum to 10.\n\nPlay on SudokuPad!","solutionCode":"Row 9","tags":["Sudoku","Quadruple (Variante)","Kropki Pairs (Variante)","Little Killer (Variante)","Arrows (Variante)","X-Sums (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/51fswrx8o8","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/51fswrx8o8","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":4,"hasSolution":true,"features":["arrows","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-31T02:28:04+00:00"}